This is a PLACEHOLDER file for the RedForge Windows sidecar (redforge-sidecar.exe).

DO NOT RUN THIS FILE.

To produce the real sidecar for Windows deployment:
1. On a Windows machine with Python:
   cd sidecar
   pip install -r requirements.txt pyinstaller
   pyinstaller redforge-sidecar.spec
2. Copy dist/redforge-sidecar/redforge-sidecar.exe here (overwrite this file).
3. Then run `npm run tauri build` from the redforge root (on Windows for best results).

See README.md "Building the Windows Version" for details.

RedForge v0.5.0 - For authorized use only.
